{
  "schema": "loadsketch/brief@1",
  "id": "brief-geocode",
  "title": "需求：查地址",
  "text": "2 人團隊，兩週。做一個查地址的 API：把地址換成座標。座標由外部的地圖供應商算，它已經在畫布上。它每 20 次會失敗 1 次。",
  "functional": [
    "其他服務能用地址查到座標"
  ],
  "load": [
    "每秒 1,500 個請求，全部是讀取",
    "你的 API 失敗率不能超過 1%，雖然供應商自己有 5%"
  ],
  "given": [
    "地圖供應商查一次平均 30 ms，失敗率 5%，這些改不了",
    "你的程式處理一個請求平均 5 ms"
  ],
  "outOfScope": [
    "地址的格式檢查",
    "供應商的計費",
    "換另一家供應商"
  ],
  "scenario": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/scenario@1",
    "name": "需求：查地址",
    "seed": 1,
    "durationS": 60,
    "warmupS": 5,
    "traffic": {
      "rps": 1500,
      "readRatio": 1
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "maxErrorRate": 0.01,
    "maxP99Ms": 200,
    "budgetPerMonth": 1200,
    "maxPoints": 5
  },
  "start": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "需求：查地址",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "users",
        "kind": "client",
        "label": "使用者",
        "pos": [
          0,
          200
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "geo",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "地圖供應商（外部）",
        "pos": [
          0,
          380
        ],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": {
            "mean": 30,
            "cv": 0.5
          },
          "queueLimit": 200,
          "errorRate": 0.05
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": []
  },
  "fixed": [
    "geo"
  ],
  "needs": [
    {
      "kind": "reaches-node",
      "node": "geo",
      "text": "查詢有送到地圖供應商",
      "op": "calls",
      "share": 0.05
    },
    {
      "kind": "not-degraded"
    }
  ],
  "hint": "供應商每次有 5% 會失敗，而且每次失敗互不相關。失敗了再試一次，兩次都失敗的機率是 5% × 5% = 0.25%。在「API → 地圖供應商」那條線上設重試。重試會讓供應商多收約 5% 的請求，它吃得下；要是它是因為太忙才失敗，重試只會更糟。",
  "reference": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "需求：查地址",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "users",
        "kind": "client",
        "label": "使用者",
        "pos": [
          0,
          200
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "lb",
        "kind": "load_balancer",
        "label": "負載平衡器",
        "pos": [
          270,
          200
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "api",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "查地址 API",
        "pos": [
          540,
          200
        ],
        "params": {
          "instances": 3
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "geo",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "地圖供應商（外部）",
        "pos": [
          810,
          200
        ],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": {
            "mean": 30,
            "cv": 0.5
          },
          "queueLimit": 200,
          "errorRate": 0.05
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "users",
        "to": "lb"
      },
      {
        "from": "lb",
        "to": "api"
      },
      {
        "from": "api",
        "to": "geo",
        "retries": 1
      }
    ]
  },
